<title>POLAND: Bank Gdanski 1996 group results.</title>
<headline>Bank Gdanski 1996 group results.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Gdanski group results for the the financial year ending December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>							  1996</p>
<p>    group operating profit			164.32</p>
<p>    group pre-tax profit			  171.12</p>
<p>    group net profit				110.19</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Bank Gdanski SA. Comparison figures were not available.</p>
<p>    group revenues from securities		5.65</p>
<p>    group interest and similar revenues     740.11</p>
<p>    group interest and similar costs	  433.05</p>
<p>    group revenues from commission	     82.74</p>
<p>    group costs of commission		     5.62</p>
<p>    group income tax				 63.86</p>
<p>    group other taxes				 0.00</p>
<p>    group extraordinary profit		    0.01</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
